WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.570
Hi I'm Leslie, I'm a blogger and if you
want to know how to get this glittery

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:11.219
festival look - keep watching. To start
I prime my face with the Benefit Pore

00:00:11.219 --> 00:00:15.780
Professional Pearl Primer, I apply this
with my fingers all over my face and rub

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:24.660
in. For foundation I like the NARS
Natural Radiant Longwear Foundation. I'm

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:33.450
dotting this all over my face before
blending in with my fingertips. I then

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:37.320
go in with a little concealer, I'm using
Too Faced Born This Way Naturally

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:42.649
Radiant Concealer and I dab this over
any areas I want to brighten.

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:49.790
I'm keeping my brows soft and natural so
for this I love the Estee Lauder

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:54.170
Brow Now Volumizing Brow Tint. I brush
this over my brow starting at the edge

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:59.330
and working my way out following the
natural shape of my brows. To add a

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:03.170
little warmth on the cheeks I'm using
the Smashbox Cali Contour Palette. I

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:08.030
apply a matte bronzer shade first with
a bronzing brush and then I add the

00:01:08.030 --> 00:01:11.590
matte blush shade to add some colour.

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:17.329
To highlight, I love the NARS Iluminator
in Copacabana.This is one of my favourite

00:01:17.329 --> 00:01:20.719
highlights and I love to use this on the
tops of my cheekbones and my eyebrow

00:01:20.719 --> 00:01:29.479
bone. Now for the fun part, I'm using NYX
glitter in Bronze Dubai and Lumi Light.

00:01:29.479 --> 00:01:33.619
So one of my hacks for getting the
glitter to stick is using a lip balm I'm

00:01:33.619 --> 00:01:38.000
using the Lanolips 101 Ointment Multibalm. So you can

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:41.179
either apply this with a brush or use
your finger to dab. Then I go in with the

00:01:41.179 --> 00:01:45.049
glitter. I love mixing two shades
together to give it more dimension. To

00:01:45.049 --> 00:01:52.670
finish this glittery eye I love adding
stars to really make this look pop. Don't

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:58.689
forget to add definition. I'm using the
Smashbox Super Fan fanned out mascara.

00:02:00.610 --> 00:02:05.569
Finally to finish this festival look I'm
using Too Faced Melted Chocolate on my

00:02:05.569 --> 00:02:18.380
lips. I love the shimmer and it smells
amazing. For more videos like this

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:22.569
subscribe to GLAMOUR UK's YouTube
channel.

